# The direct dependencies of server.py. requirements.txt comes from here, with
# the indirect ones and the hash of each wheel, valid for amd64 and arm64:
#
#   uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 \
#     requirements.in -o requirements.txt
#
# The versions are the ones that exported the .onnx and measured the delivery.
# Another runtime is another number: changing any of them requires checking
# again, as the README says.
